oney to fund the  program i have faith  that the good people out there that  understand the importance of programs  like this are going to continue to  outpace the trolls and the haters and  that the program will continue to go and  a lot to grow and along those lines i'll  very quickly tell you about the best  ways to support the show the first one  being this may come as a surprise to you  because i really don't mention  membership very often it is this thing  called membership and you can go to our  brand new website  which by the way people absolutely love  i'm hearing out there and people tell me  all the time trust me on this this  website is finally winning again  davidpakman.com  membership you can sign up for  membership we have a cool slider that  gives you inspirational messages the  higher you drag it when you're choosing  your level of support that is the main  foundation for supporting the david  pakman show but there are other ways if  you ever shop on amazon.com  you can go to davidpakman.com  amazon that'll redirect you to amazon  everything you buy will send us a little  kickback you can also interact with our  social media platforms one of course  being the discussion forum on reddit  which you can get to by going to  davidpakman.com  reddit you can also like the show on  facebook where we now have surpassed 50  000 likes at facebook.com  davidpakmanshow and then you can follow  both me and the show on twitter the show  is at twitter.com  davidpakmanshow we are well on our way  to 100 000 followers there and you can  also follow me on twitter  twitter.compacman  not doing quite as well there uh closing  in on 50 000 twitter followers and  lastly  instagram.com  david.pakman we post pictures there we  do sometimes post  instagram only discount codes for  membership on instagram  anything you can do to support the show  is of course hugely appreciated most of  this stuff doesn't cost you any money  and it's just showing that there is  buy-in  and to